# Expansion Ports Kconfig
# The expansion port I2C bus is driven by the BSP's own core2foraws_i2c
# driver (esp_driver_i2c master API). The per-device baud rate is set at
# runtime via the scl_speed_hz argument to
# core2foraws_expports_i2c_device_add(), so no Kconfig symbols are needed.
# This file is kept to satisfy the rsource include in the parent Kconfig.